&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/releases/tag/4.0.122.0"&gt;4.0.122.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;4.0.122.0 (2025-10-29 20:21 UTC)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BedrockRuntime (4.0.9.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for system tool and web citation response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CloudFront (4.0.7.3)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add PreMarshallCustomization custom partial method.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DynamoDBv2 (4.0.9.3)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixes issue &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3543431776" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/4071" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/4071/hovercard" href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/4071"&gt;#4071&lt;/a&gt;. Allow null expression attribute values for update and conditional expression for transact writes.&lt;/li&gt;
